   "stem": "求曲线 z = √(1 + x² + y²)，x = 1 在点 (1, 1, √3) 处的切线对 y 轴的斜率。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 √3/3。将 x = 1 代入得 z = √(2 + y²)，dz/dy = y/√(2 + y²)，在 y = 1 处 dz/dy = 1/√3 = √3/3，故切线对 y 轴的斜率为 √3/3。",
   "needs_review": false
