   "num": 123,
   "stem": "求下列函数的二阶偏导数在指定点的值：\n(1) f(x, y) = x·sin(y/x)，求 f″xy(2, π/2)；\n(2) f(x, y) = ∫₀^(xy) sin t/(1 + t²) dt，求 f″xx(0, 2)。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 (1) √2π/16；(2) 4。f′x = sin(y/x) − (y/x)·cos(y/x)，f″xy = (y/x²)·sin(y/x)，在 (2, π/2) 处 f″xy = (π/8)·(√2/2) = √2π/16。(2) f′x = y·sin(xy)/(1 + x²y²)，f″xx = y·[y·cos(xy)·(1 + x²y²) − 2xy²·sin(xy)]/(1 + x²y²)²，在 (0, 2) 处 f″xx = 2·[2·1·1 − 0]/1 = 4。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
