   "num": 127,
   "stem": "求 z = x²y + xy² 在点 (2, 1) 处，当 Δx = 0.1，Δy = −0.2 时的全微分。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 Δz = −1.128，dz = −1.1。全增量：Δz = f(2.1, 0.8) − f(2, 1) = (2 + 0.1)²(1 − 0.2) + (2 + 0.1)(1 − 0.2)² − (2²×1 + 2×1²) = −1.128。全微分：A = ∂z/∂x = 2xy + y²，B = ∂z/∂y = x² + 2xy，在 (2, 1) 处 A = 5，B = 8，dz = 5×0.1 + 8×(−0.2) = −1.1。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 128,
   "stem": "求下列函数的全微分：\n(1) z = (x² + y²)·e^(arctan(y/x))；\n(2) z = sin x + sin(xy) + ∫₀^(2x+y) e^(−t²) dt。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 (1) dz = (2x − y)·e^(arctan(y/x))dx + (x + 2y)·e^(arctan(y/x))dy。(2) dz = [cos x + y·cos(xy) + 2e^(−(2x+y)²)]dx + [x·cos(xy) + e^(−(2x+y)²)]dy。(1) 设 u = arctan(y/x)，∂u/∂x = −y/(x² + y²)，∂u/∂y = x/(x² + y²)，则 ∂z/∂x = 2x·eᵘ + (x² + y²)·eᵘ·∂u/∂x = (2x − y)eᵘ，∂z/∂y = (x + 2y)eᵘ。(2) 由变限积分求导公式，∂z/∂x = cos x + y·cos(xy) + 2e^(−(2x+y)²)，∂z/∂y = x·cos(xy) + e^(−(2x+y)²)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 129,
   "stem": "设 u = arcsin(z/(x + y))（x + y > 0），求 du。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 du = [−z·dx − z·dy + (x + y)·dz]/[(x + y)·√((x + y)² − z²)]。设 w = z/(x + y)，则 ∂w/∂x = ∂w/∂y = −z/(x + y)²，∂w/∂z = 1/(x + y)，且 1/√(1 − w²) = (x + y)/√((x + y)² − z²)，由链式法则整理即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 130,
   "stem": "设 z = z(x, y) 由方程 z − x − y + x·eᶻ = 0 确定，求 dz。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz = [(1 − eᶻ)dx + dy]/(1 + x·eᶻ)。对方程两边求全微分：dz − dx − dy + eᶻ·dx + x·eᶻ·dz = 0，整理得 (1 + x·eᶻ)dz = (1 − eᶻ)dx + dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
