   "stem": "设 f(x, y) = (2x + 3y)/(1 + xy)，求 df 在点 (0, 0) 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 df|(0,0) = 2dx + 3dy。由 f(x, 0) = 2x 得 f′x(0, 0) = lim_{x→0}(f(x, 0) − f(0, 0))/x = 2；由 f(0, y) = 3y 得 f′y(0, 0) = 3。故 df|(0,0) = f′x(0, 0)dx + f′y(0, 0)dy = 2dx + 3dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 132,
   "stem": "设 f(x, y) 在点 (0, 0) 处连续，且 lim_{(x,y)→(0,0)} [f(x, y) − x − 2y − 1]/(x² + y²) = 1，求 df 在点 (0, 0) 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 df|(0,0) = dx + 2dy。由极限条件及 f 在 (0, 0) 连续得 f(0, 0) = 1，且 f(x, y) − f(0, 0) = x + 2y + (x² + y²)(1 + α)，其中 α → 0（当 (x, y) → (0, 0)），故 f 在 (0, 0) 可微且 df|(0,0) = dx + 2dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
