   "num": 134,
   "stem": "设全微分 df = y·eʸ·dx + [x(1 + y)·eʸ + 2y]dy，且 f(0, 0) = 2，求 f(x, y) 的表达式。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 f(x, y) = xy·eʸ + y² + 2。由 ∂f/∂x = y·eʸ 对 x 积分得 f(x, y) = xy·eʸ + φ(y)；代入 ∂f/∂y = x(1 + y)eʸ + φ′(y) = x(1 + y)eʸ + 2y，得 φ′(y) = 2y，φ(y) = y² + C；由 f(0, 0) = 2 得 C = 2。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
