   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 143,
   "stem": "设 z = u² + v² + sin(uv)，其中 u = eˣ，v = x²，求 dz/dx。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz/dx = 4x³ + 2e²ˣ + x(x + 2)eˣ·cos(x²eˣ)。dz/dx = ∂z/∂u·(du/dx) + ∂z/∂v·(dv/dx)，其中 ∂z/∂u = 2u + v·cos(uv)，∂z/∂v = 2v + u·cos(uv)，u = eˣ，v = x²。代入得 dz/dx = [2eˣ + x²cos(x²eˣ)]·eˣ + [2x² + eˣcos(x²eˣ)]·2x = 4x³ + 2e²ˣ + x(x + 2)eˣcos(x²eˣ)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 144,
   "stem": "设 f(x, y) = arcsin(xy)，其中 y = ln x，求 dz/dx。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz/dx = (ln x + 1)/√(1 − x²ln²x)。dz/dx = ∂f/∂x + ∂f/∂y·(dy/dx) = y/√(1 − x²y²) + x/√(1 − x²y²)·(1/x) = (y + 1)/√(1 − x²y²) = (ln x + 1)/√(1 − x²ln²x)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 145,
   "stem": "设 z = f(x·φ(x), x² + φ²(x))，其中 f，φ 均可导，求 dz/dx。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz/dx = [φ(x) + x·φ′(x)]·f′₁ + 2[x + φ(x)·φ′(x)]·f′₂。设 u = x·φ(x)，v = x² + φ²(x)，则 dz/dx = f′₁·u′ + f′₂·v′ = [φ(x) + xφ′(x)]f′₁ + [2x + 2φ(x)φ′(x)]f′₂。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
