   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 d²z/dx² = 2f′₁ − 4f′₂·sin 2x + 4x²f″₁₁ + 8x·f″₁₂·cos 2x + 4f″₂₂·cos²2x。dz/dx = 2x·f′₁ + 2cos 2x·f′₂，再对 x 求导（f′₁、f′₂ 仍为复合函数）：d²z/dx² = 2f′₁ + 2x(2x·f″₁₁ + 2cos 2x·f″₁₂) − 4sin 2x·f′₂ + 2cos 2x(2x·f″₁₂ + 2cos 2x·f″₂₂)，化简即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
