  {
   "num": 149,
   "stem": "设 z = f(x, y, u) = ln arctan u，其中 u = √(x² + y²)，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = x/[(1 + x² + y²)·√(x² + y²)·arctan√(x² + y²)]，∂z/∂y = y/[(1 + x² + y²)·√(x² + y²)·arctan√(x² + y²)]。z 对 x、y 的偏导只通过 u 传递：∂z/∂x = f′u·(x/u)，其中 f′u = 1/[(1 + u²)·arctan u]，u = √(x² + y²)，u² = x² + y²；∂z/∂y 同理。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 150,
   "stem": "设 z = e^(x²+y²+u²)，其中 u = x²·sin y，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = 2x(1 + 2x²sin²y)·e^(x²+y²+x⁴sin²y)，∂z/∂y = (2y + x⁴·sin 2y)·e^(x²+y²+x⁴sin²y)。u = x²sin y，u² = x⁴sin²y。指数 x² + y² + u² 对 x 的偏导为 2x + 2u·2x·sin y = 2x + 4x³sin²y，对 y 的偏导为 2y + 2u·x²cos y = 2y + x⁴sin 2y。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 151,
   "stem": "设 z = f(x·arcsin y, y/x)，其中 f 具有一阶连续偏导数，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = arcsin y·f′₁ − (y/x²)·f′₂，∂z/∂y = [x/√(1 − y²)]·f′₁ + (1/x)·f′₂。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 152,
   "stem": "设 z = f(x + y, x² − y²)，其中 f 具有二阶连续偏导数，求 ∂²z/∂x²，∂²z/∂y²。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂²z/∂x² = f″₁₁ + 4x·f″₁₂ + 4x²f″₂₂ + 2f′₂，∂²z/∂y² = f″₁₁ − 4y·f″₁₂ + 4y²f″₂₂ − 2f′₂。∂z/∂x = f′₁ + 2x·f′₂，∂²z/∂x² = f″₁₁ + 2x·f″₁₂ + 2x(f″₂₁ + 2x·f″₂₂) + 2f′₂；∂z/∂y = f′₁ − 2y·f′₂，∂²z/∂y² = f″₁₁ − 2y·f″₁₂ − 2y(f″₂₁ − 2y·f″₂₂) − 2f′₂。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 153,
   "stem": "设 z = f(e^(xy), x² + y²)，其中 f 具有二阶连续偏导数，求 ∂²z/∂x∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂²z/∂x∂y = (1 + xy)e^(xy)·f′₁ + xy·e^(2xy)·f″₁₁ + 2(x² + y²)e^(xy)·f″₁₂ + 4xy·f″₂₂。∂z/∂x = y·e^(xy)·f′₁ + 2x·f′₂，再对 y 求偏导并利用 f″₁₂ = f″₂₁ 整理即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 154,
   "stem": "设 z = eˣ − y + f(x − 2y)，且当 y = 0 时，z = x³，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = eˣ + 3(x − 2y)² − e^(x−2y)，∂z/∂y = −1 − 6(x − 2y)² + 2e^(x−2y)。当 y = 0 时 z = eˣ + f(x) = x³，故 f(t) = t³ − e^t，f′(t) = 3t² − e^t。∂z/∂x = eˣ + f′(x − 2y)，∂z/∂y = −1 − 2f′(x − 2y)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 155,
   "stem": "设 z = y·f(x² − y²)，其中 f 可导，且 f(0) = 1，f′(0) = 1/2，求 dz 在点 (1, 1) 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz|(1,1) = dx。∂z/∂x = 2xy·f′(x² − y²)，∂z/∂y = f(x² − y²) − 2y²·f′(x² − y²)。在 (1, 1) 处：∂z/∂x = 2f′(0) = 1，∂z/∂y = f(0) − 2f′(0) = 1 − 1 = 0，故 dz|(1,1) = dx。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 156,
   "stem": "）\n设 z = f (2x +y) + f (x − 2y) +\nZ x2+y2\nx−y\ng(t)dt，其中 f 具有二阶导数，g 具有一阶导数，求\n∂2z\n∂x∂y 。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 157,
   "stem": "）\n设 z =xy +xf\n\u0010y\nx\n\u0011\n，其中 f 二阶可导，证明：\n(1) x∂z\n∂x +y∂z\n∂y =xy +z；\n(2) x2∂2z\n∂x2 =y2∂2z\n∂y 2 。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 158,
   "stem": "设 z = x·f(u)，u = x/y，其中 f(u) 可导，且 x·∂z/∂x − y·∂z/∂y = 0，f(1) = 1，求 f(u) 的表达式。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 f(u) = 1/√u。∂z/∂x = f(u) + (x/y)·f′(u)，∂z/∂y = −(x²/y²)·f′(u)。代入 x·∂z/∂x − y·∂z/∂y = 0 得 f(u) + 2u·f′(u) = 0，即 df/f = −du/(2u)，解得 f(u) = C/√u。由 f(1) = 1 得 C = 1。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 159,
   "stem": "设 z = f(2x − y) + g(x, xy)，其中 f 具有二阶偏导数，g 具有连续的二阶偏导数，求 ∂²z/∂x² 和 ∂²z/∂x∂y。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂²z/∂x² = 4f″(2x − y) + g″₁₁ + 2y·g″₁₂ + y²·g″₂₂，∂²z/∂x∂y = −2f″(2x − y) + x·g″₁₂ + g′₂ + xy·g″₂₂。∂z/∂x = 2f′(2x − y) + g′₁ + y·g′₂（g 的两个中间变量为 u = x，v = xy）。再对 x 求导：∂²z/∂x² = 4f″ + (g″₁₁ + y·g″₁₂) + y(g″₂₁ + y·g″₂₂)；再对 y 求导：∂²z/∂x∂y = −2f″ + x·g″₁₂ + g′₂ + y·x·g″₂₂。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 160,
   "stem": "设 u = f(x, y, x·eʸ)，其中 f 具有连续的二阶偏导数，求 ∂²u/∂x² 和 ∂²u/∂y²。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂²u/∂x² = f″₁₁ + 2eʸ·f″₁₃ + e²ʸ·f″₃₃，∂²u/∂y² = f″₂₂ + 2x·eʸ·f″₂₃ + x²·e²ʸ·f″₃₃。设第三个中间变量 w = x·eʸ。∂u/∂x = f′₁ + eʸ·f′₃，再对 x 求导得第一式；∂u/∂y = f′₂ + x·eʸ·f′₃，再对 y 求导（利用 f″₂₃ = f″₃₂）得第二式。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 161,
   "stem": "）\n设 u =f (x,y,z )，y =φ(x,t )，t =ψ(x,z )，其中 f ，φ，ψ 均可导，求 ∂u\n∂x 和 ∂u\n∂z 。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 162,
   "stem": "）\n设 g(u,v ) 具有连续的二阶偏导数，f (x,y ) = g(2x +y, 3x −y) 满足 f ′′\nxx +f ′′\nxy − 6f ′′\nyy = 1 ，求\ng′′\nuv。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 163,
   "stem": "）\n设 f (x,y ) 具有连续的二阶偏导数，且为 x，y，t 的二次齐次函数，满足 f (tx,ty ) = t2f (x,y )。\n证明：\n(1) xf ′\nx +yf ′\ny = 2f ；\n(2) x2f ′′\nxx + 2xyf ′′\nxy +y2f ′′\nyy = 2f 。\n二、全微分形式不变性\n设 z =f (u,v ) 具有连续偏导数，u =φ(x,y )，v =ψ(x,y ) 也具有连续偏导数，则无论u，v 是\n自变量还是中间变量，全微分 dz 的形式保持不变：\ndz = ∂z\n∂u du + ∂z\n∂v dv.\n这一性质称为全微分形式不变性。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 164,
   "stem": "设 z = arctan(u + v)，u = 2x − y²，v = x²y，利用全微分形式不变性求 dz。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz = [(2 + 2xy)dx + (x² − 2y)dy]/(1 + (2x − y² + x²y)²)。由全微分形式不变性：dz = (du + dv)/(1 + (u + v)²)，du = 2dx − 2y·dy，dv = 2xy·dx + x²·dy，u + v = 2x − y² + x²y，代入整理即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 165,
   "stem": "设 z = f(2x + 3y, eʸ)，其中 f 可导，求 dz。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz = 2f′₁·dx + (3f′₁ + eʸ·f′₂)dy。设 u = 2x + 3y，v = eʸ，则 dz = f′₁·du + f′₂·dv = f′₁(2dx + 3dy) + f′₂·eʸ·dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 166,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x) 满足 eˣ + cos y = x·y²，求 dy/dx。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dy/dx = (eˣ − y²)/(sin y + 2xy)。设 F(x, y) = eˣ + cos y − xy²，则 F′x = eˣ − y²，F′y = −sin y − 2xy，由隐函数求导公式 dy/dx = −F′x/F′y。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 167,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x) 满足 2ʸ = x + y + 1，求 dy/dx 在 x = 0 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dy/dx|x=0 = 1/(2ln 2 − 1)。由 2ʸ = x + y + 1，当 x = 0 时 y = 1。设 F(x, y) = 2ʸ − x − y − 1，则 F′x = −1，F′y = 2ʸ·ln 2 − 1，dy/dx = −F′x/F′y = 1/(2ʸ·ln 2 − 1)，代入 (0, 1) 得 1/(2ln 2 − 1)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 168,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x) 满足 y − x·eʸ + x = 0，求 d²y/dx² 在 x = 0 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 d²y/dx²|x=0 = 0。由 y − x·eʸ + x = 0，当 x = 0 时 y = 0。对 x 求导：y′ − eʸ − x·eʸ·y′ + 1 = 0，代入 x = 0, y = 0 得 y′(0) = 0。再求导：y″ − 2eʸ·y′ − x·eʸ(y′² + y″) = 0，代入 (0, 0, y′=0) 得 y″(0) = 0。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 169,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x) 满足 x·f(x + y) = eˣ·ln y，其中 f 可导，求 dy/dx。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dy/dx = (y·eˣ·ln y − y·f − xy·f′)/(xy·f′ − eˣ)。对方程 x·f(x + y) = eˣ·ln y 两边关于 x 求导：f(x + y) + x·f′(x + y)·(1 + y′) − eˣ·ln y − (eˣ/y)·y′ = 0，解出 y′ 并整理即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 170,
   "stem": "设 z = f(ln y − sin x)，其中 f(u) 具有二阶导数且 f′(0) = 1，y = y(x) 满足 y − x·e^(y−1) = 1，求 dz/dx 在 x = 0 处的值和 d²z/dx² 在 x = 0 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz/dx|x=0 = 0，d²z/dx²|x=0 = 1。由 y − x·e^(y−1) = 1，x = 0 时 y = 1；两边对 x 求导得 y′ − e^(y−1) − x·e^(y−1)·y′ = 0，得 y′(0) = 1；再求导得 y″ − 2e^(y−1)·y′ − x·e^(y−1)(y′² + y″) = 0，得 y″(0) = 2。设 u = ln y − sin x，dz/dx = f′(u)·(y′/y − cos x)，在 x = 0 处 u = 0，y′/y − cos x = 1 − 1 = 0，故 dz/dx|x=0 = 0。d²z/dx² = f″(u)·(y′/y − cos x)² + f′(u)·(y″/y − (y′/y)² + sin x)，在 x = 0 处 = 0 + 1×(2 − 1 + 0) = 1。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 171,
   "stem": "）\n设 xy −z lny +exz = 1，则在点 (0, 1, 1) 的某邻域内，下列哪个结论正确？\n(A) 可确定 z = z(x,y ) (B) 可确定 y = y(x,z ) (C) 可确定 x = x(y,z ) (D) 不能确定任何\n隐函数",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "single",
   "has_answer": false,
   "answer_text": "",
   "needs_review": true
  },
  {
   "num": 172,
   "stem": "设 z + x·e^(z−x−y) = x + y，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = [1 + x·e^(z−x−y) − e^(z−x−y)]/(1 + x·e^(z−x−y))，∂z/∂y = 1。设 F(x, y, z) = z + x·e^(z−x−y) − x − y，则 F′x = (1 − x)e^(z−x−y) − 1，F′y = −x·e^(z−x−y) − 1，F′z = 1 + x·e^(z−x−y)，由隐函数求导公式 ∂z/∂x = −F′x/F′z，∂z/∂y = −F′y/F′z。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 173,
   "stem": "设 xy = x·f(z) + y·φ(z)，其中 x·f′(z) + y·φ′(z) ≠ 0，求 ∂z/∂x，∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x = [y − f(z)]/(x·f′(z) + y·φ′(z))，∂z/∂y = [x − φ(z)]/(x·f′(z) + y·φ′(z))。设 F(x, y, z) = xy − x·f(z) − y·φ(z)，则 F′x = y − f(z)，F′y = x − φ(z)，F′z = −x·f′(z) − y·φ′(z)，由隐函数求导公式即得。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 174,
   "stem": "设 (x − y)³ + z + tan z = 0，求 ∂z/∂x + ∂z/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂z/∂x + ∂z/∂y = 0。设 F(x, y, z) = (x − y)³ + z + tan z，则 F′x = 3(x − y)²，F′y = −3(x − y)²，F′z = 1 + sec²z。∂z/∂x = −3(x − y)²/(1 + sec²z)，∂z/∂y = 3(x − y)²/(1 + sec²z)，相加为 0。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 175,
   "stem": "设 eᶻ − x·y² + sin(y + z) = 0，求 dz。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz = [y²·dx + (2xy − cos(y + z))·dy]/(eᶻ + cos(y + z))。对方程两边求全微分：eᶻdz − y²dx − 2xy·dy + cos(y + z)(dy + dz) = 0，整理得 (eᶻ + cos(y + z))dz = y²dx + (2xy − cos(y + z))dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 176,
   "stem": "设 xyz + √(x² + y² + z²) = √2，求 dz 在点 (1, 0, 1) 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dz|(1,0,1) = −dx − √2·dy。设 F(x, y, z) = xyz + √(x² + y² + z²) − √2，F′x = yz + x/√(x² + y² + z²)，F′y = xz + y/√(x² + y² + z²)，F′z = xy + z/√(x² + y² + z²)。在 (1, 0, 1) 处 F′x = 1/√2，F′y = 1，F′z = 1/√2，故 z′x = −1，z′y = −√2。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 177,
   "stem": "设 z³ − 3xyz = 1，求 ∂²z/∂x²。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 ∂²z/∂x² = 2xy³z/(xy − z²)³。∂z/∂x = yz/(z² − xy)（由 F′x = −3yz，F′z = 3z² − 3xy）。对 x 再求导并代入 ∂z/∂x 化简得 ∂²z/∂x² = 2xy³z/(xy − z²)³。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 178,
   "stem": "设 z + eˣ − y·ln(1 + z²) = 0，求 z″xx(0, 0) + z″yy(0, 0)。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 z″xx(0, 0) + z″yy(0, 0) = −1 − 2ln 2。x = 0，y = 0 时 z = −1。设 F = z + eˣ − y·ln(1 + z²)，F′x = eˣ，F′y = −ln(1 + z²)，F′z = 1 − 2yz/(1 + z²)，得 z′x(0, 0) = −1，z′y(0, 0) = ln 2。再求二阶偏导并代入 (0, 0, −1) 得 z″xx(0, 0) = −1，z″yy(0, 0) = −2ln 2。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 179,
   "stem": "设 f(x, y, z) = y·z²·eˣ，其中 z = z(x, y) 由方程 x + y + z + xyz = 0 确定，求 f′x(0, 1, −1)。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 f′x(0, 1, −1) = 1。由 x + y + z + xyz = 0 对 x 求偏导：1 + z′x + yz + xy·z′x = 0，得 z′x = −(1 + yz)/(1 + xy)。f′x = y·z²·eˣ + 2yz·eˣ·z′x。在 (0, 1, −1) 处 z′x = 0，故 f′x(0, 1, −1) = 1×(−1)²×1 + 0 = 1。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 180,
   "stem": "设 u = f(x, y, z) 具有连续偏导数，z = z(x, y) 由方程 x·eˣ − y·eʸ = z·eᶻ 确定，求 du。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 du = [f′₁ + f′₃·(1 + x)e^(x−z)/(1 + z)]dx + [f′₂ − f′₃·(1 + y)e^(y−z)/(1 + z)]dy。对方程 x·eˣ − y·eʸ = z·eᶻ 两边求全微分：(1 + x)eˣdx − (1 + y)eʸdy = (1 + z)eᶻdz，故 ∂z/∂x = (1 + x)e^(x−z)/(1 + z)，∂z/∂y = −(1 + y)e^(y−z)/(1 + z)。u = f(x, y, z(x, y))，du = (f′₁ + f′₃·∂z/∂x)dx + (f′₂ + f′₃·∂z/∂y)dy。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 181,
   "stem": "设 f(u, v) 可导，f(1, 1) = 0，z = z(x, y) 满足 (x + 1)z − y² = x·f(x + z, x + y)，求：(1) dz 在点 (0, 1) 处的值；(2) ∂²z/∂y² 在点 (0, 1) 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 (1) dz|(0,1) = −dx + 2dy；(2) ∂²z/∂y²|(0,1) = 2。将 x = 0, y = 1 代入方程：z − 1 = 0·f(1, 1) = 0，得 z = 1。方程两边对 x 求偏导：z + (x + 1)·∂z/∂x = f(x + z, x + y) + x·[f′₁·(1 + ∂z/∂x) + f′₂]，代入 (0, 1, 1) 得 1 + ∂z/∂x = f(1, 1) = 0，故 ∂z/∂x|(0,1) = −1。方程两边对 y 求偏导：(x + 1)·∂z/∂y − 2y = x·[f′₁·∂z/∂y + f′₂]，代入得 ∂z/∂y − 2 = 0，故 ∂z/∂y|(0,1) = 2，dz|(0,1) = −dx + 2dy。对 y 再求导：(x + 1)·∂²z/∂y² − 2 = x·[f″₁₁·(∂z/∂y)² + 2f″₁₂·∂z/∂y + f″₂₂ + f′₁·∂²z/∂y²]，代入 (0, 1, 1) 得 ∂²z/∂y²|(0,1) = 2。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 182,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x)，z = z(x) 由方程组 x + 2y + 3z = 0，x² + y² + z² = 2 确定，求 dy/dx，dz/dx。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dy/dx = (3x − z)/(2z − 3y)，dz/dx = (y − 2x)/(2z − 3y)（2z − 3y ≠ 0 时）。方程组两边对 x 求导：1 + 2·dy/dx + 3·dz/dx = 0；2x + 2y·dy/dx + 2z·dz/dx = 0。由第一式 dy/dx = (−1 − 3·dz/dx)/2，代入第二式得 2x − y − 3y·dz/dx + 2z·dz/dx = 0，故 dz/dx = (y − 2x)/(2z − 3y)，回代得 dy/dx = (3x − z)/(2z − 3y)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 183,
   "stem": "设 u = u(x, y)，v = v(x, y) 由方程组 u² + xv − y = 0，yu + v² − x = 0 确定，求 ∂u/∂x，∂v/∂x，∂u/∂y，∂v/∂y。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 记雅可比行列式 D = |2u x; y 2v| = 4uv − xy。当 D ≠ 0 时，方程组两边对 x 求偏导：2u·∂u/∂x + v + x·∂v/∂x = 0；y·∂u/∂x + 2v·∂v/∂x − 1 = 0。由克拉默法则解得 ∂u/∂x = −(2v² + x)/(4uv − xy)，∂v/∂x = (2u + yv)/(4uv − xy)。方程组两边对 y 求偏导：2u·∂u/∂y + x·∂v/∂y − 1 = 0；u + y·∂u/∂y + 2v·∂v/∂y = 0。解得 ∂u/∂y = (2v + xu)/(4uv − xy)，∂v/∂y = −(2u² + y)/(4uv − xy)。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 184,
   "stem": "设 y = y(x)，z = z(x) 由方程组 z = x·f(x − y)，x + y + z·eᶻ = 1 确定，其中 f 可导，且 f(−1) = 1，求 dy/dx 在 x = 0 处的值和 dz/dx 在 x = 0 处的值。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 dy/dx|x=0 = −2，dz/dx|x=0 = 1。将 x = 0 代入方程组：z = 0·f(−y) = 0；y + 0 = 1，得 y = 1（此时 x − y = −1，与 f(−1) = 1 相符）。第一式 z = x·f(x − y) 两边对 x 求导：dz/dx = f(x − y) + x·f′(x − y)·(1 − dy/dx)，代入 x = 0 得 dz/dx|x=0 = f(−1) = 1。第二式 x + y + z·eᶻ = 1 两边对 x 求导：1 + dy/dx + eᶻ·dz/dx + z·eᶻ·dz/dx = 0，代入 x = 0, y = 1, z = 0, dz/dx = 1 得 1 + dy/dx + 1 + 0 = 0，故 dy/dx|x=0 = −2。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 185,
   "stem": "设 u = f(x, y, z) 具有连续偏导数，y = y(x)，z = z(x) 分别由方程 e^(xy) + 2y = 0 和 eᶻ − xz = 2 确定，求 du/dx。",
   "difficulty": 2,
   "diff_label": "中等题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 du/dx = ∂f/∂x + [y²/(1 − xy)]·∂f/∂y + [z/(xz − x + 2)]·∂f/∂z。由 e^(xy) + 2y = 0 两边对 x 求导：e^(xy)·(y + x·dy/dx) + 2·dy/dx = 0，得 dy/dx = −y·e^(xy)/(2 + x·e^(xy))；又 e^(xy) = −2y，故 dy/dx = 2y²/(2 − 2xy) = y²/(1 − xy)。由 eᶻ − xz = 2 两边对 x 求导：eᶻ·dz/dx − z − x·dz/dx = 0，得 dz/dx = z/(eᶻ − x) = z/(xz − x + 2)。于是 du/dx = ∂f/∂x + ∂f/∂y·dy/dx + ∂f/∂z·dz/dx。",
   "needs_review": false
  },
  {
   "num": 186,
   "stem": "求曲线 x = t + 1，y = t² − 1，z = t³ 在点 (2, 0, 1) 处的切线方程和法平面方程。",
   "difficulty": 1,
   "diff_label": "基础题",
   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 切线方程：(x − 2)/1 = y/2 = (z − 1)/3；法平面方程：x + 2y + 3z = 5。点 (2, 0, 1) 对应 t = 1。切向量 τ = (1, 2t, 3t²)|t=1 = (1, 2, 3)。切线：(x − 2)/1 = (y − 0)/2 = (z − 1)/3。法平面：1·(x − 2) + 2·(y − 0) + 3·(z − 1) = 0，即 x + 2y + 3z = 5。",
   "needs_review": false
