   "type": "calc",
   "has_answer": true,
   "answer_text": "解 切平面方程：x − y + z = −2；法线方程：x/1 = (y − 1)/(−1) = (z + 1)/1。设 F = x² + cos(xy) + yz + x，则 F′x = 2x − y·sin(xy) + 1，F′y = −x·sin(xy) + z，F′z = y。在 (0, 1, −1) 处：∇F = (1, −1, 1)。切平面：1·(x − 0) + (−1)·(y − 1) + 1·(z + 1) = 0，即 x − y + z = −2。法线：x/1 = (y − 1)/(−1) = (z + 1)/1。",
   "needs_review": false
